      "description": "A GovTech / RegTech company founded in 2023 and based in Buea, Cameroon. SIGIL builds sovereign governance infrastructure for public institutions, banks and other critical institutions, and private companies: the institution holds the cryptographic keys, its data stays under its control, and every consequential action is authorized, bounded, and proven. Its systems are VIGIL (a governed cybersecurity and evidence platform), RÉCOR (a beneficial-ownership registry built to the Beneficial Ownership Data Standard v0.4) and APEX (anti-corruption intelligence for public procurement).",
